msgid "The Routes"
msgstr "라우트"

#: ../../source/libraries/uploaded_files.rst:101
msgid ""
"Using a text editor, open **app/Config/Routes.php**. In it, add the "
"following two routes:"
msgstr ""
"텍스트 편집기를 사용하여 **app/Config/Routes.php**\ 를 엽니다. "
"그 안에 다음 두 라우트를 추가합니다:"

#: ../../source/libraries/uploaded_files.rst:106
msgid "The Upload Directory"
msgstr "업로드 디렉터리"

#: ../../source/libraries/uploaded_files.rst:108
msgid "The uploaded files are stored in the **writable/uploads/** directory."
msgstr "업로드된 파일은 **writable/uploads/** 디렉터리에 저장됩니다."

